	(text "FTDI cable order. Pin 4 is the cable TXD,\ninto the Pi RXD. Pin 5 is the cable RXD.\nPin 3, VCC, stays open: a 5 V cable cannot\nback-feed the Pi. 115200 8N1.\nSilkscreen: 3.3 V ONLY, GND at pin 1, 115200 8N1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
